1
00:00:59,434 --> 00:01:04,856
I am Kim Jae-hoon,
Proxy Driver

2
00:01:05,732 --> 00:01:10,320
Once, I lived as a respected human being
with a full-time job.

3
00:01:12,489 --> 00:01:15,700
But now, I am nothing more than a "proxy"

4
00:01:22,373 --> 00:01:26,002
A nameless driver
who jumps at every command

5
00:01:26,336 --> 00:01:31,174
takes all the abuse,
and has to cater to every drunken whim.

6
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:36,387
Student loans are still pending,

7
00:01:36,387 --> 00:01:39,390
and I couldn't even pay this month's rent

8
00:01:39,849 --> 00:01:42,852
Everyone has the right to live with dignity.

9
00:01:43,478 --> 00:01:48,191
But inside this car,
that belief is trampled every single moment.

10
00:02:52,088 --> 00:02:57,051
Jae-hoon, you're doing okay, right? Don't push yourself too hard. I'm doing fine, so just focus on staying healthy

11
00:02:58,595 --> 00:03:01,514
"Fine," my foot...

12
00:03:01,514 --> 00:03:04,517
You can't even afford the doctor
if I don't send you money.

13
00:03:09,522 --> 00:03:12,150
Driver App

14
00:03:19,657 --> 00:03:26,080
You bitch... you fucking bitch...
how could you do this to me?

15
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:33,463
Get the hell out, you bitch!

16
00:03:35,882 --> 00:03:38,885
Hello. Did you call for a driver?

17
00:04:04,661 --> 00:04:07,997
"Proxy Driver"

18
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,800
(Episode 1)

19
00:04:42,156 --> 00:04:45,159
Sir, we have arrived.

20
00:04:46,744 --> 00:04:49,747
I said, we've arrived, sir.

21
00:05:12,270 --> 00:05:15,898
What the hell?
Look at this piece of shit.

22
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:23,031
Hello? Is this the police station?
I caught a thief here.

23
00:05:23,573 --> 00:05:26,284
Sir? Oh, I am so sorry.

24
00:05:26,284 --> 00:05:28,578
I lost my mind for a second.

25
00:05:28,578 --> 00:05:31,331
Please forgive me.
Just this once.

26
00:05:32,123 --> 00:05:33,291
I'll never do it again

27
00:05:33,291 --> 00:05:35,043
I'll do anything you tell me to.

28
00:05:35,793 --> 00:05:36,961
Really?

29
00:05:42,342 --> 00:05:43,551
Suck it.

30
00:05:45,845 --> 00:05:46,596
...What?

31
00:05:47,138 --> 00:05:48,806
I said, suck it.

32
00:05:50,641 --> 00:05:51,976
That's... I can't...

33
00:05:55,021 --> 00:05:56,564
Look at this prick.

34
00:05:56,564 --> 00:05:58,066
Hello?

35
00:06:02,653 --> 00:06:05,365
ok. I'll do it.

36
00:06:05,615 --> 00:06:07,367
Should've done that from the start

37
00:06:24,759 --> 00:06:29,097
You better do a good job
if you don't want to rot in jail.

38
00:08:20,124 --> 00:08:23,794
Is it... is it over now? Can I go?

39
00:08:29,008 --> 00:08:29,926
Scumbag.
